Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.40,0:01:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.20,0:01:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.90,0:02:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.40,0:02:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很遺憾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:17.80,0:02:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.40,0:02:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 醫生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:21.40,0:02:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請你救救Candy吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.70,0:02:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個 如果能救的話 我肯定…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:27.40,0:02:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫生你應該可以治好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.50,0:02:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy對我來說可是唯一的家人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.20,0:02:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:39.40,0:02:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy 不要死啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:41.40,0:02:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,馬上 馬上醫生就會治好你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.80,0:02:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 請你救救Candy吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.60,0:02:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy 拜託你不要死啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要丟下我一個啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:59.50,0:03:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.00,0:03:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}聽不到的叫聲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.90,0:03:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看 會是什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:30.90,0:03:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,純子以前就想要一隻小狗了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:33.80,0:03:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝爸爸 媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.70,0:03:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可憐 才十歲啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.60,0:03:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父母就去世了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.60,0:03:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,純子 差不多該走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:52.50,0:03:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy 我們兩個要一起努力哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.00,0:04:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy 等等啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:18.80,0:04:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.60,0:04:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy 我以後該怎麼辦好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,純子 晚飯要涼了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放在這裏了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:55.80,0:04:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本條醫生 不得了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.40,0:05:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木先生的小狗碰到交通事故
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.60,0:05:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腿部骨折了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.90,0:05:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,馬上就帶來 剛來了電話的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.60,0:05:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.40,0:05:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那隻狗就交給你吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.10,0:05:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我現在必須得去給小泉老師的狗看病
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.50,0:05:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 醫生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骨折這種小事 自然就能好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.80,0:05:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:19.70,0:05:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,5點要給Puruto注射可別忘了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:21.90,0:05:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個女演員的狗如果死了就麻煩了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.60,0:05:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 就交給你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:45.40,0:05:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,純子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,關本小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.90,0:05:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 Candy的事還是要感謝你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.60,0:05:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那個時候有點驚慌失措
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.30,0:05:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以沒有好好向你道謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:04.50,0:06:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫生呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在正好外出診察了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:09.50,0:06:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.10,0:06:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係的 我會幫你傳達給醫生的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.30,0:06:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在怎麼樣 精神有沒有恢復了些
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.40,0:06:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還好 不過還是不習慣獨自一人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.80,0:06:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是一直悶悶不樂也不是個辦法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.60,0:06:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 我想Candy應該是很幸福的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.40,0:06:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能得到本條醫生這麼好的醫生最後的照顧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:39.70,0:06:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼請您代我向醫生問好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:52.50,0:06:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:55.10,0:06:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛纔幫你打了止痛劑 馬上就不會難受了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:14.20,0:07:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託你不要死啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.10,0:07:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要丟下我一個啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.70,0:07:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,關本小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.10,0:07:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 把你叫出來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.90,0:07:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係 反正在家也沒什麼事做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.40,0:07:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 要和我說什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:44.60,0:07:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.00,0:07:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 其實在那個時候議員河合先生打電話來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.30,0:07:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高爾夫嗎 我是沒問題啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:56.00,0:07:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一起去的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是給河合先生添麻煩嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:00.30,0:08:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.50,0:08:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 是 沒什麼沒什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.50,0:08:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有那回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:04.70,0:08:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:04.90,0:08:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那時只是碰巧而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.90,0:08:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起我 還是河合先生您5號洞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:08.90,0:08:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那杆攻果嶺真是漂亮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.10,0:08:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 我真的是碰巧啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:13.80,0:08:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是運氣好而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.00,0:08:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.80,0:08:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:18.30,0:08:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月底的星期二吧 我正好有空
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.50,0:08:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不 完全沒問題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.00,0:08:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.60,0:08:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:28.70,0:08:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那Candy不是沒有接受任何診治嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.30,0:08:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,電話掛斷後雖然進行了治療
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:35.40,0:08:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過那時已經太晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.30,0:08:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那時我要是強行掛斷電話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.80,0:08:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種事就
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.40,0:08:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.90,0:08:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然不是道歉就能受到你的原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.00,0:08:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到純子你之後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:50.40,0:08:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我實在不忍心隱瞞了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:53.00,0:08:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那間診所就是那樣的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人的吧 這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它那麼痛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.30,0:09:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就爲了這種電話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.90,0:09:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種事 一定是騙人的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.70,0:09:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請原諒 純子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.80,0:09:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.80,0:09:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我沒有帶你去看那種醫生就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.50,0:09:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天的靈異特別節目看了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:32.90,0:09:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超恐怖啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:34.60,0:09:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,話說回來 你知道地獄通信嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:37.80,0:09:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道啊知道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.10,0:09:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點登錄的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:41.30,0:09:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能幫你消除怨恨的那個網頁吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:44.20,0:09:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是就是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.20,0:09:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說部林高中裏真的有人試過哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.50,0:09:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.80,0:09:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄通信 地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.90,0:09:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼找不到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.80,0:10:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:38.60,0:10:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 有郵件了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:51.20,0:10:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在就去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.00,0:11:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼又不見了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.90,0:11:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 快連上啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.30,0:11:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.80,0:11:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.90,0:11:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你呼喚我的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.30,0:11:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 你是地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.30,0:11:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:26.90,0:11:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:30.90,0:11:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:33.80,0:11:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那樣就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.70,0:11:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:44.70,0:11:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開這個就行了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.30,0:11:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.40,0:11:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.60,0:11:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.40,0:11:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:55.00,0:11:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:57.00,0:11:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,締結契約後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:58.70,0:12:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無法前往極樂淨土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:05.30,0:12:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將飽嘗痛楚與苦難
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.20,0:12:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永遠徘徊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過這是你死之後的事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:21.00,0:12:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:29.90,0:12:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後的事 就由你自己抉擇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.70,0:12:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.80,0:12:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開這根紅線的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.30,0:12:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨就能消除了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:57.80,0:12:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辦不到 辦不到啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原諒我吧 Candy
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.40,0:13:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy那麼痛苦地死去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:04.30,0:13:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我 我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.30,0:13:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼接下來 是一起鉅額瀆職事件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.70,0:13:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本臺朝丸新聞的記者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.20,0:13:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,採訪了處於本事件焦點的那個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:20.10,0:13:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有證據啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:21.80,0:13:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己承認怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:23.60,0:13:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做了那種事 以爲會被原諒嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:26.10,0:13:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請回答
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:27.10,0:13:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請讓一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.80,0:13:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,證據
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 只要有證據
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:32.80,0:13:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有哪家電視臺可以報道那個醫生的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.10,0:13:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這不行吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:38.00,0:13:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個診所有很多政治家和名人經常光顧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.60,0:13:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種言論就算通過媒體流傳出去也會馬上被抹殺的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.40,0:13:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是這樣的話Candy它
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:50.00,0:13:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是Candy 還有其他的狗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:55.10,0:13:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個醫生無法原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:57.60,0:13:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都是信任他才把寵物帶去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:02.30,0:14:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 關本小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:05.60,0:14:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.90,0:14:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏很暗 要注意腳下哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了啊 這隻狗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在交通事故中腳骨折了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:25.30,0:14:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,馬上手術的話 就不會這麼嚴重了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.90,0:14:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起這個 還是抓緊時間吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:31.80,0:14:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十點還不離開這裏 本條就要回來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查病歷沒用哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他都重新改過的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.60,0:14:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以還是過來幫忙吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.50,0:14:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他冒充使用了高價藥並向客人收費
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:51.90,0:14:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,庫存可能與清單不符
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:54.80,0:14:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿米拖爾（一種鎮靜劑）7箱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 對 是7箱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:59.80,0:15:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼 完全相符
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:03.20,0:15:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪 不可能的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:06.00,0:15:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:10.80,0:15:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.00,0:15:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情我都從關本小姐那裏聽說了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:15.00,0:15:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy那麼痛苦 你還打高爾夫球電話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.80,0:15:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:22.90,0:15:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你從關本那裏聽說了什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:26.40,0:15:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy 我可是盡全力了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:29.00,0:15:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別胡說了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:30.40,0:15:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy是被你殺死的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:32.60,0:15:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你的所作所爲全部在媒體前公開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:36.40,0:15:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此 所以跑來尋找證據吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:40.40,0:15:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 找到證據了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:43.80,0:15:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果沒有證據就不要說些奇怪的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:48.00,0:15:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是問問當事者怎麼樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:57.60,0:16:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣 我是個那麼壞的醫生嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:03.50,0:16:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在說什麼我可聽不懂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:06.50,0:16:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說清楚點讓我聽懂吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.10,0:16:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,過分 太過分了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.60,0:16:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來吧 怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:15.90,0:16:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有什麼想說的就說吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:18.10,0:16:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別說了 我已經受夠了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.00,0:16:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對你來說它們或許是單純的賺錢工具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.70,0:16:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但對於大家都是重要的寵物啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:27.50,0:16:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Candy更是純子唯一的家人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.30,0:16:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.50,0:16:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那條髒狗還當做家人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:35.40,0:16:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正只是這附近撿來的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:37.90,0:16:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種狗跑來只會把醫院弄髒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:41.60,0:16:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄的臭氣熏天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:42.90,0:16:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏是什麼地方啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.50,0:16:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那種狗 爲了醫院也應該早點死比較好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:49.60,0:16:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:51.30,0:16:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下醫生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.80,0:16:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這次我就放過你們了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.20,0:16:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是下次再聽到你們奇怪的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就告你們誹謗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.10,0:17:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別以爲你還能在這行混飯喫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.90,0:17:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然說早點死比較好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:09.80,0:17:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能原諒 不能原諒啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:26.40,0:17:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.50,0:17:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 長衫放好了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:44.00,0:17:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝 婆婆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:30.60,0:18:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然只爲了條狗 這麼晚還把我叫出來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:34.70,0:18:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我會好好敲你一筆的 給我記住
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:48.30,0:18:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.00,0:18:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從那種地方跑出來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:52.30,0:18:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骨頭斷了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:00.00,0:19:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這可又是個撞得厲害的車禍
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:02.40,0:19:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他擡出來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.60,0:19:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.50,0:19:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是哪裏啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:20.30,0:19:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫院
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:21.50,0:19:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:23.40,0:19:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫生嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:24.40,0:19:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我的腿骨折了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:26.50,0:19:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快幫我治啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.80,0:19:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看了嗎 昨天的比賽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.60,0:19:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個漂亮的全壘打啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.20,0:19:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棒球的事情怎麼都好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.10,0:19:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 快點治我的腿啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:35.40,0:19:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:37.10,0:19:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個是暗號失誤吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:39.10,0:19:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲那球可是投向正中央的直線球啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:42.30,0:19:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,餵你們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:43.30,0:19:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不管病人的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.40,0:19:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別閒聊了 快替我治療啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:48.30,0:19:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就這麼彎起胳膊一揮 球就飛出去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:48.70,0:19:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說棒球的事情怎樣都好了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:51.60,0:19:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快點治我的腿啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:53.30,0:19:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯沒錯 這種球我也可以打出全壘打了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:55.00,0:19:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們有沒有聽我講話啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:57.70,0:19:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你們了 求你們了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:59.80,0:20:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快看看我的腿啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:03.10,0:20:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 開始手術吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:09.70,0:20:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是哪裏的問題呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.00,0:20:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是啊 病人的話都聽不懂呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:15.10,0:20:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腳啊 腿骨折了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:16.30,0:20:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就從隨便切開來看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:22.70,0:20:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們準備切哪裏啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.50,0:20:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是這裏 是腿啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:26.20,0:20:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的腿受傷了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:27.60,0:20:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:29.80,0:20:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對自己的所作所爲有所悔悟了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:33.60,0:20:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對你來說動物或許只是賺錢工具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.70,0:20:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是對於愛護他們人就相當於家人了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:41.70,0:20:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家人 別開玩笑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.70,0:20:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他們不也是跟我一樣嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:47.40,0:20:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓它們穿上奇怪的衣服 帶着它們參加聚會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:49.80,0:20:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它們當作炫耀自己身份的工具而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:52.50,0:20:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼只有我要受這種痛苦啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:55.50,0:20:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我並沒有什麼錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他這麼說呢 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:01.20,0:21:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:04.60,0:21:06.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:07.20,0:21:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:10.80,0:21:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:28.30,0:21:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:32.50,0:21:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是哪裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:33.90,0:21:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要帶我去哪裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:38.50,0:21:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.30,0:21:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫生 我好痛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:41.20,0:21:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:45.30,0:21:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 不要過來 不要過來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:50.70,0:21:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:52.60,0:21:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:09.40,0:22:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,關本小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:11.10,0:22:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,純子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:12.70,0:22:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你來送我了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:14.70,0:22:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說你要回鄉下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:16.80,0:22:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 都是我的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:19.50,0:22:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係啦 倒是我該向你道歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:22.30,0:22:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且呢 鄉下也能找到和動物相關的工作的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:27.70,0:22:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,10點9分開往福岡的希望號馬上就要發車了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:30.60,0:22:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼我走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:32.30,0:22:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一找到工作我就會告訴你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:34.60,0:22:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再見了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:37.90,0:22:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 媽媽 Candy
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:41.70,0:22:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,見不到你們雖然感覺很寂寞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:44.50,0:22:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也會繼續努力的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.70,0:22:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 請你們在天上保佑我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.30,0:22:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:14.40,0:23:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:20.90,0:23:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て 　{\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:27.80,0:23:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ　{\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ　{\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:44.90,0:23:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:48.70,0:23:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:59.70,0:24:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:06.70,0:24:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:29.45,0:24:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:32.70,0:24:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:34.40,0:24:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浦野美沙裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:36.50,0:24:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無法原諒麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:38.60,0:24:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個人根本不會把人命當回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:42.60,0:24:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說什麼這個世界上只有地位和名譽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:44.70,0:24:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人生說來不過是一場遊戲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:48.00,0:24:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:50.00,0:24:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將她流放到地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:53.20,0:24:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.00,0:25:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.00,0:25:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}高塔上的女人
